- column  Transition
- column  A reading in it
- column  By default
- column  Otherwise
- row  clocks spring forward  falls in a *gap*, and never happens  is pushed forward  `gapPolicies.pushBackwardGapPolicy` pushes it backward; `gapPolicies.rejectGapPolicy` raises a `Moment.Error`
- row  clocks fall back  falls in an *overlap*, and names two instants  is the first occurrence  `Occurrence.Second` names the later one
+ column  Transición
+ column  Una lectura en ella
+ column  Por defecto
+ column  En otro caso
+ row  los relojes se adelantan  cae en un *hueco*, y nunca ocurre  se empuja hacia delante  `gapPolicies.pushBackwardGapPolicy` la empuja hacia atrás; `gapPolicies.rejectGapPolicy` lanza un `Moment.Error`
+ row  los relojes se retrasan  cae en un *solapamiento*, y nombra dos instantes  es la primera ocurrencia  `Occurrence.Second` nombra la posterior

= row  clocks fall back  falls in an *overlap*, and names two instants  is the first occurrence  `Occurrence.Second` names the later one
- ```
+ ```

