- By default, arithmetic on moments is lenient. It works in civil time, and steps over leap
- seconds as though they were not there. Choosing the exact mode counts them. Adding two hours
- across the leap second at the end of 2016 then lands one second short of the lenient answer:
+ Por defecto, la aritmética con momentos es permisiva. Trabaja en tiempo civil, y pasa por encima
+ de los segundos intercalares como si no estuvieran. Elegir el modo exacto los cuenta. Sumar dos
+ horas a través del segundo intercalar de finales de 2016 cae entonces un segundo antes que la
+ respuesta permisiva:

= across the leap second at the end of 2016 then lands one second short of the lenient answer:
=
- ```scala fuel
+ ```scala fuel

